{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:02 2026-05-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:02 2026-05-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:02 2026-05-27 HKT</p><p>不少港人假日港車北上到內地時，都會經過的珠海華發商都日前發生斬人事件。網傳事發於周一（25日）下午，事發地點為該商場的星巴克咖啡店附近。</p><img alt=\"網傳珠海華發商場發生斬人事件，一名男子頭部受傷。互聯網\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24e852fe419e6a6818ee7d697e6d077a/2026-05/FDownloader_Net_AQM1caJafdDxYaQMPZxu8Cgv-iTueMHU2L3UebQIVb7E9VdVje5EQzwB4y8xWn13KpAVMZ9t6YA3cg3tAQuHsviVXmvMzMm74bvldb-m2nWhPw_720p__HD_mp4_snapshot_00_01__2026_05_27_22_53_02_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"網傳珠海華發商場發生斬人事件，一名男子頭部受傷。互聯網\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/565a2744426c3c613072117fce460200/2026-05/FDownloader_Net_AQM1caJafdDxYaQMPZxu8Cgv-iTueMHU2L3UebQIVb7E9VdVje5EQzwB4y8xWn13KpAVMZ9t6YA3cg3tAQuHsviVXmvMzMm74bvldb-m2nWhPw_720p__HD_mp4_snapshot_00_03__2026_05_27_22_53_07_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"網傳珠海華發商場發生斬人事件，一名男子頭部受傷倒地。互聯網\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42809551ae9b92aad434f635ca7e7d6e/2026-05/FDownloader_Net_AQM1caJafdDxYaQMPZxu8Cgv-iTueMHU2L3UebQIVb7E9VdVje5EQzwB4y8xWn13KpAVMZ9t6YA3cg3tAQuHsviVXmvMzMm74bvldb-m2nWhPw_720p__HD_mp4_snapshot_00_11__2026_05_27_22_53_19_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"疑兇手持利刀物體。互聯網\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/daa70c2f382d887d77dc5e783bf86348/2026-05/FDownloader_Net_AQM1caJafdDxYaQMPZxu8Cgv-iTueMHU2L3UebQIVb7E9VdVje5EQzwB4y8xWn13KpAVMZ9t6YA3cg3tAQuHsviVXmvMzMm74bvldb-m2nWhPw_720p__HD_mp4_snapshot_00_20__2026_05_27_22_53_32_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"網傳珠海華發商場發生斬人事件，一名男子頭部受傷。互聯網\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6c824f138ad52658c5fc1107d71e5525/2026-05/FDownloader_Net_AQM1caJafdDxYaQMPZxu8Cgv-iTueMHU2L3UebQIVb7E9VdVje5EQzwB4y8xWn13KpAVMZ9t6YA3cg3tAQuHsviVXmvMzMm74bvldb-m2nWhPw_720p__HD_mp4_snapshot_00_05__2026_05_27_22_53_47_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"刀手將兇器棄置地上。互聯網\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17a1d0bf75e8760c309ddb728971a3c4/2026-05/FDownloader_Net_AQM1caJafdDxYaQMPZxu8Cgv-iTueMHU2L3UebQIVb7E9VdVje5EQzwB4y8xWn13KpAVMZ9t6YA3cg3tAQuHsviVXmvMzMm74bvldb-m2nWhPw_720p__HD_mp4_snapshot_00_22__2026_05_27_22_54_08_.jpg\"/><p>據網傳影片所見，一名身穿黑色上衣和短褲的男子雙手按著頭，全身染血，疑似後腦中刀。男子原本尚清醒，但未幾就坐在地上，之後更躺在地上。一名同樣身穿黑衣的疑兇在附近徘徊，更將手上的刀掉在地上。</p><p>有消息指，疑兇未有離開現場，後來被警察拘捕。而遇襲男子傷勢未明，官方亦未有通報案件詳情。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-27T15:20:06.511296+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":290,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}